'''Corl '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "C0RL". It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired. 

== Appearance ==
The Corl knife has a bright blue blade that fades into a dark blue with 4 mini apples on as well. The guard is navy blue and the handle is solid black.
== Trivia ==

* This is 1 of 5 youtuber code knives. The others being [[Denis]], [[Sub]], [[Alex]] and  [[Sketchy|Sketchy,]] not including [[JD]], a very special [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]] knife.
* Like every other [[Codes|code]], this [[Codes|code]] has expired.

